Kubēra issues as Yakṣas flee --- Prahasta Mahōdara Mārīca slaughter thousands --- Māṇibhadra fells Dhūmrākṣa --- Rāvaṇa strikes Māṇibhadra sidelong crowning him Pārśvamauli --- Kubēra reproaches Rāvaṇa with moral verses --- Kubēra routs ministers and strikes Rāvaṇa unmoved --- Kubēra looses Āgnēya missile met by Vāruṇa --- Rāvaṇa fells Kubēra with māyā mace stroke --- Nidhis revive Kubēra while Rāvaṇa seizes gold-pillared Puṣpaka
